        -:   36:/**
        -:   37: * A class to manage Component Classes in a board context
        -:   38: *
        -:   39: * This manager owns generated COMPONENT_CLASS objects, and guarantees that pointers to managed
        -:   40: * objects are valid for the duration of the board lifetime. Note that, in order to maintain this
        -:   41: * guarantee, there are two methods that must be called when updating the board from the netlist
        -:   42: * (InitNetlistUpdate and FinishNetlistUpdate).
        -:   43: */
        -:   44:class COMPONENT_CLASS_MANAGER
